{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Implementation complete. Final module map (name -> LOC -> contract): completion.py -> 252 -> verifier orchestration + stable facade (re-exports child-gate/reconcile symbols; gate_ops + tests keep importing from rebar.llm.completion); completion_child_gate.py -> 200 -> child-closure gate (child_closure_findings, _uncertified_child_ids, build_child_closure_evidence); completion_reconcile.py -> 246 -> verdict reconciliation (reconcile_verdict, deterministic_child_failure, remediation constants, _REVIEWER_ID/_OUTPUT_SCHEMA); epic_bug_screen.py -> 453 -> absorbed the epic bug-screen DET layer (epic_bug_floor_findings, epic_bug_candidates, _epic_subtree_states, EPIC_BUG_SCREEN_CEILING) next to its LLM screen; completion_recovery.py -> 423 -> CompletionAgentStep orchestration only (re-exports explicit_completion_criteria, physical_context_ceiling, raise_completion_workflow_failure); completion_criteria.py -> 210 -> criteria contract (enumeration, admission bounds, coverage validation); completion_failures.py -> 234 -> failure taxonomy (exhaustion classification, bounded diagnostics, workflow-failure finalization). All modules 200-500 LOC; largest src/rebar file now 800 (pre-existing inbound_differ.py, untouched). Gates: make lint PASS (complexity ratchet new=0 increased=0), make typecheck PASS (547 files). Tests: 845 unit + 198 focused completion/recovery/banking/epic/interfaces-store passed; tests/interfaces 1823 passed. The only failures are pre-existing environmental (host git safe.bareRepository config breaks bare-repo fixtures in test_bridge_provider_wrappers_heldout, test_mcp_push_status, test_tracker_config_e2e, test_bridge_runner_install_paths_heldout) - confirmed failing identically on unmodified origin/main. String-reference sweeps caught and repointed: test_epic_bug_screen_4b54 monkeypatch targets (EPIC_BUG_SCREEN_CEILING line 229, epic_bug_floor_findings line 449) plus 8 attribute-call sites; test_completion_verification_workflow _REVIEWER_ID import (moved with the reconcile cluster). Kept valid UNCHANGED via facade re-exports: rebar.llm.completion.child_closure_findings / .build_child_closure_evidence / .verify_completion patch strings, rebar.llm.workflow.completion_recovery.physical_context_ceiling patch string, and all _cr./cr. module-alias reads not listed in the plan's repoint set. No assertion changes anywhere. Pushing to Gerrit next."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786762945077811001,"uuid":"6d87ce1b-74f8-4161-b461-3268949d4fb4"}